text = "
			                      Version Notes
____________________________________________

Sprint 4:

- Came up with a tentative title for the game
- Added a player attack animation
- Added an \"Exit Game\" button to the title screen
- Added a proper pause menu with \"Resume\" and \"Exit Game\" buttons
- Changed the game to be the proper resolution and made it auto-fullscreen
- Made some important technical changes to the player and enemy attacks
____________________________________________

Sprint 3:

- Added a basic attack button, which currently just plays an animation and cuts user input
- Added a jumping animation and sound effect
- Added a falling animation
- Added enemy sprites and animations
- Added the ability to take damage and die
- Added a pause button (very early implementation)
- Added a controls screen to explain the controls
- Changed version notes font size for easier readability
____________________________________________

Sprint 2:

- Added basic level tiles
- Added a basic level scene for testing
- Made it so the \"Start\" button opens a test level
- Added player scene with basic movement (walk, jump, double jump)
- Added player sprites & animations (idle, run, wing jump)
- Added a basic, temporary player health bar
- Added basic pathfinding enemy scene which follows the player when they're nearby
- Changed the credits to scroll slightly faster
____________________________________________

Sprint 1:

- Added WPI splash screen
- Added Main Menu scene
- Added \"Start\", \"Version History\", and \"Credits\" buttons
- Added scrollable Version History
- Added autoscrolling Credits
- Added main menu music

"
